Q: echo problem in audio/video chat application A: <p>I came across the same echo problem and managed to solve it by muting the localVideo stream and setting its volume to zero while also using this configuration for getUserMedia:</p>
<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>        const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({
          video: true,
          audio: {
            autoGainControl: false,
            echoCancellation: &quot;remote-only&quot;,
            noiseSuppression: false,
          },
        });
</code></pre>
<pre><code>   this.localVideoEl.volume = 0;
</code></pre>
